org/wiki/Force_Power"}," is a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Swift Action"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Swift_Action"},". If you take damage while maintaining ",{"tag":"i","children":["Valor"]},", you must succeed on a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Use the Force"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Use_the_Force","referenceId":"reference:74883d1dd46b87fe"}," check (DC = 15 + damage taken) to continue maintaining the ",{"tag":"i","children":["Valor"]},". You may have multiple instances of ",{"tag":"i","children":["Valor"]}," active at once (affecting different allies), but maintaining each one requires a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Swift Action"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Swift_Action"}," each round, and each one must be activated by a separate use of ",{"tag":"i","children":["Valor"]},".\n"]},"\n","\n","\n","\n\n","\n\n","\n"]}}
